<title>USA: St Paul hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts compared with Thursday, were $0.50 lower. Top $54.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	   220-250 lbs    54.50</p>
<p>			 250-260 lbs    54.00-54.50</p>
<p>			 260-270 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3	   270-280 lbs    52.00-53.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $3.00. Top $51.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	   300-450 lbs    45.00-45.50, few 46.00</p>
<p>			 450-500 lbs    47.00-47.50</p>
<p>			 500-550 lbs    48.00-48.50</p>
<p>			 550-700 lbs    51.00</p>
</text>
